<title>USA: Graco Inc Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Graco Inc Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands except share amounts)</p>
<p>				    Third quarter	    Nine Months</p>
<p>				     1996	1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> NET SALES		     $97,680  $94,797 $284,932 $293,726</p>
<p> GROSS PROFIT		   49,976   46,287  144,235  144,229</p>
<p>  Product development	  4,714    3,557   13,566   11,419</p>
<p>  Selling			 21,624   21,982   62,714   65,740</p>
<p>General and administrative</p>
<p>				     8,316   10,263   29,996   32,345</p>
<p> OPERATING PROFIT	     15,322   10,485   37,959   34,725</p>
<p>EARNINGS BEFORE INCOME TAXES</p>
<p>				    14,857    9,669   37,674   32,137</p>
<p>  Income taxes		   4,700    3,100   11,900   11,600</p>
<p> NET EARNINGS		   10,157    6,569   25,774   20,537</p>
<p>NET EARNINGS PER COMMON</p>
<p> SHARE				0.58     0.37     1.47     1.18</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>  number of common shares   17,410   17,524   17,518   17,409</p>
<p>NOTE: Current period ended September 27, 1996. Year-ago period ended September 29, 1995.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
